{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218070","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1521807001:0":{"text":"バルトシアはヤクボルの領地だ！草木一本ったりともお前たちに奪わせはしないぞ！","source_cn":"水泽营地是雅库伯尔的领地，里面一草一木都属于雅库伯尔！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD064372F85F4FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521807002:0":{"text":"あれは<style=\"highlight\">俺たちが残していった物</style>だ！","source_cn":"那是<style=highlight>我们留下的东西<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA649B69005BA33EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521807003:1":{"text":"全員静かに！","source_cn":"都闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDEA30A832FA5FF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521807004:0":{"text":"ホーリンの領主、これは一体どういうことだ？","source_cn":"你，呼临的领主。怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FA75F858897EE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521807005:0":{"text":"余の兵士が、その……バルトシアにいた頃、いくつか置いていった物があるのだ。それを持って帰ろうとして……","source_cn":"我的士兵们之前……唔，待在水泽营地的时候，遗留了一些东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162AA23321960C35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female