cument_title_status":""},"say:17:1521807011:0":{"text":"だが、奴は強い戦士でもあった。","source_cn":"但他很强，是个不错的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D2881AB990815E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521807012:0":{"text":"ザルカ、人間どもが残した物はどこにある？","source_cn":"泽卡，东西在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59C745CC84DC1637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521807013:0":{"text":"こいつらは負けたんだぞ。あれはもう俺たちの物だ！","source_cn":"战败的是呼临，那些东西就应该随雅库伯尔处置！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x839ED491840FAF0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521807014:0":{"text":"もう一度聞く。物はどこだ？","source_cn":"我再问一遍。东西在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC62D69B7A9A2F565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521807015:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521807016:0":{"text":"ぐっ……<style=\"highlight\">拠点の外に捨てた</style>。<style=\"highlight\">北の方</style>だよ。","source_cn":"我……我把呼临人的东西都<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB886A